# Reviewer 2 #15 (2026-04-24): integration suite reinstated.
# tests/integration/ is VCS-tracked; use scripts/run_integration_test.py
# (wraps scripts/isaac_python.sh) to execute against Isaac Sim.  The
# default pytest run skips the `integration` marker, so unit CI stays
# GPU-free.  Do NOT re-exclude tests/integration/ or any test_*.py
# underneath it without pairing with a CI change.

